[en.FOCUS_C12_MONOPOLY_MINE_DEVELOPMENT]
Monopoly Mine Development

[en.FOCUS_C12_MONOPOLY_MINE_DEVELOPMENT_desc]
In recent years, relatively liberal policies allowed the rock farm to be dotted with numerous private pony mines, but that must come to an end. I will no longer tolerate other families or companies trying to meddle in the Pie family’s mining business; they must either agree to follow the proper procedures and accept a low-priced buyout, or I will simply confiscate them.

[zh.FOCUS_C12_MONOPOLY_MINE_DEVELOPMENT]
垄断矿场开发权

[zh.FOCUS_C12_MONOPOLY_MINE_DEVELOPMENT_desc]
前几年较为开放的政策让采石农场遍布着许多私马矿场，但是这一切该走向停止了，我不会再容忍别的家族或者企业试图干涉派家族的矿产生意，他们要么同意走流程低价收购，要么我直接没收掉。

